    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d599">

                <pb facs="0665" n="407" sameAs="frus:frus1915Supp/pg407"/>

                <head>
                    <hi rendition="#italic">The Secretary of State to the
                        Ambassador in Germany</hi> (<hi
                            rendition="#italic">Gerard</hi>)</head>
                <opener>
                    <seg rendition="#center">[Telegram]</seg>
                </opener>
                <opener>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right">
                        <placeName>
                            <hi rendition="#small-caps">Washington</hi></placeName>, <date
                            calendar="gregorian" when="1915-05-24">
                            <hi rendition="#italic">May 24, 1915</hi>.</date>
                    </dateline>
                </opener>
                <p>Answering your 2277, May 22, 12 m., have asked Dumba to call at 4 p. m. Will secure from him and cable you a
                    statement denying the reported communication to Zimmermann, or correcting the construction placed upon it. I
                    need not tell you that there is absolutely no justification for his report and
                    you will please so notify the Government at once. The Government must not, for a
                    moment, misunderstand the language or intent of the note regarding the submarine
                    attack on the <hi rendition="#italic">Lusitania, Gulflight, Gushing</hi>, and
                        <hi rendition="#italic">Falaba</hi>.</p>
                <closer>
                    <signed>
                        
                            <hi rendition="#small-caps">Bryan</hi>
                        
                    </signed>
                </closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
